Program interface:
Return Python source defining a top-level Solution class inheriting rsikit.Controller.
The constructor receives observation_space, action_space, and instructions.
Implement async act(self, observation) returning a valid action. Optional async
reset(self, *, seed=None) should call await super().reset(seed=seed) and clear
policy state. Optional async close(self) releases resources.
The policy cannot access the environment or its reward calculation. Its state
persists for one episode. The standard Docker worker provides Python, NumPy,
and Gymnasium, with no network or host files. Do not add an executable main block.

